MaaFramework iOS protocol implementation

Derived from the validated scrctl protocol implementation, commit d429fd5,
https://github.com/YJBeetle/scrctl, copyright its contributors, Apache License 2.0.
This is independently built source maintained inside MaaFramework. It does not
load, execute or link a scrctl checkout or executable.

Adaptations include the maa::ios namespace, independent pairing identities and
storage, framework display metadata, and removal of SDL, command-line product,
audio playback and recording functionality. External dependencies retain their
upstream licenses: lwIP (BSD), mdns (public domain), nlohmann_json (MIT),
pugixml (MIT), OpenSSL (Apache-2.0), libcurl (curl license), FFmpeg (license
depends on its build configuration; the video libraries are linked separately).
